Package: P.SamcPackage
Type: Package
Title: SAMC Simulation Package using Python and reticulate
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Dayeon", "Kim", email = "dayun0405@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Runs Example 1 from Liang, Liu and Carroll (2007),
    "Stochastic Approximation in Monte Carlo Computation" (Journal of the
    American Statistical Association, 102(477), 305-320) through a Python
    implementation, called from R via 'reticulate'. The Python source
    ships in inst/extdata and requires NumPy. See also 'R.SamcPackage'
    for the pure R reference implementation.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports: reticulate
